            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="/news">News</a>
          <a href="/photos">Photos</a>
        </nav>
        <a class="cta" href="#">Join SkillsUSA &#8594;</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero hero-sponsor">
        <div class="hero-media" role="img" aria-label="Become a Sponsor"></div>
        <div class="hero-content">
          <h1>Become a Sponsor</h1>
          <p class="hero-subtitle">Partner with SkillsUSA to develop the workforce of tomorrow</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="sponsor-intro">
        <div class="intro-content">
          <h2>Partnership Opportunity</h2>
          <p>
            SkillsUSA offers a unique opportunity for businesses and organizations to invest in the
            next generation of skilled workers while building brand visibility and community goodwill.
            Partner with us to develop career-ready professionals who will drive your industry forward.
          </p>
          <p>
            Corporate sponsors play a vital role in our mission to empower students to become skilled
            professionals, leaders, and engaged community members. Your partnership directly supports
            competitions, training programs, and the development of future talent in your industry.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="sponsorship-benefits">
        <h2 class="section-title">Why Sponsor SkillsUSA?</h2>
        <div class="benefits-grid">
          <div class="benefit-card">
            <h3>Access to Talent</h3>
            <p>
              Connect with motivated, skilled students who are preparing for careers in your industry.
              Sponsor students often become your most dedicated employees.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="benefit-card">
            <h3>Brand Visibility</h3>
            <p>
              Gain exposure through event sponsorships, competitions, and promotional materials. Your
              company name will be recognized as a workforce development leader.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="benefit-card">
            <h3>Community Impact</h3>
            <p>
              Demonstrate your commitment to education and community development. Build goodwill and
              strengthen relationships with customers and community members.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="benefit-card">
            <h3>Workforce Development</h3>
            <p>
              Help shape the skills and competencies of future workers in your field. Have a direct
              impact on the educational curriculum and training standards.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="sponsorship-tiers">
        <h2 class="section-title">Sponsorship Levels</h2>
        <div class="tiers-grid">
          <div class="tier-card">
            <div class="tier-header gold-tier">
              <h3>Gold Sponsor</h3>
              <p class="tier-range">$1,000 - $2,499</p>
            </div>
            <ul class="tier-benefits">
              <li>✓ Logo on event materials</li>
              <li>✓ Recognition on website</li>
              <li>✓ Social media promotion</li>
              <li>✓ 2 event tickets</li>
              <li>✓ Certificate of sponsorship</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="tier-card featured">
            <div class="tier-header platinum-tier">
              <h3>Platinum Sponsor</h3>
              <p class="tier-range">$2,500 - $4,999</p>
            </div>
            <ul class="tier-benefits">
              <li>✓ Premium logo placement</li>
              <li>✓ Event signage</li>
              <li>✓ Newsletter feature</li>
              <li>✓ 4 event tickets</li>
              <li>✓ Booth at competition</li>
              <li>✓ Recognition at events</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="tier-card">
            <div class="tier-header diamond-tier">
              <h3>Diamond Sponsor</h3>
              <p class="tier-range">$5,000+</p>
            </div>
            <ul class="tier-benefits">
              <li>✓ Exclusive naming rights</li>
              <li>✓ Featured event signage</li>
              <li>✓ Premium newsletter placement</li>
              <li>✓ 6 event tickets</li>
              <li>✓ Prime booth location</li>
              <li>✓ Speaking opportunity</li>
              <li>✓ Custom recognition package</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="current-sponsors">
        <h2 class="section-title">Our Valued Sponsors</h2>
        <p class="sponsors-intro">We are grateful for the support of our corporate partners and sponsors who make SkillsUSA possible.</p>
        <div class="sponsors-grid">
          <div class="sponsor-card">SECCO Electric</div>
          <div class="sponsor-card">Faulkner</div>
          <div class="sponsor-card">Hoffman Ford</div>
          <div class="sponsor-card">Remco, Inc.</div>
          <div class="sponsor-card">Pennsylvania College of Technology</div>
          <div class="sponsor-card">Ainsworth</div>
          <div class="sponsor-card">Crown Automotive</div>
          <div class="sponsor-card">AP Williams Construction</div>
          <div class="sponsor-card">DCTS Education Foundation</div>
          <div class="sponsor-card">Dauphin County</div>
          <div class="sponsor-card">Collision Repair Technology</div>
          <div class="sponsor-card">LaPorte Painting</div>
          <div class="sponsor-card">Machinery Tech</div>
          <div class="sponsor-card">IEC Pennsylvania</div>
          <div class="sponsor-card">Witmer Group</div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="sponsor-cta">
        <div class="cta-content">
          <h2>Ready to Partner with SkillsUSA?</h2>
          <p>
            Join our growing network of corporate sponsors committed to developing the next generation
            of skilled professionals. Let's work together to build a stronger workforce and community.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact" class="cta-button">Become a Sponsor Today</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

